✅ 3. K-Nearest Neighbors Algorithm
Concept

KNN is a distance-based supervised learning algorithm.

Steps:

Choose a value of K (e.g., 3,5,7).

Compute distance from the new sample to all training samples (most commonly Euclidean distance).

Pick the K closest neighbors.

Use majority voting for classification.

